            <div xml:id="d492">

                <pb facs="0669" n="559" sameAs="frus:frus1928v03/pg559"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">817.51/2011: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Minister in Nicaragua</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Eberhardt</hi>) <hi
                        rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of
                    State</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Managua</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1928-10-31T13:00:00-05:45"><hi rendition="#italic">October 31,
                                1928—1 p.m.</hi></date><lb/>[Received 5:25 p.m.]</dateline></opener>
                <p>372. Referring to my cable of September 11, 4 p.m., and despatch 801 of September
                        20th.<anchor n="82" xml:id="d492-f1"/> I have just received a letter from
                    Benard promising to set aside for the <hi rendition="#italic">guardia</hi>
                    $380,000 from the next surplus.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Eberhardt</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
